$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 10-(4-(2-(diethylamino)acetamido)phenyl)-5,5-difluoro-1,3,7,9-tetramethyl-5H-dipyrrolo[1,2-c:2',1'-f][1,3,2]diazaborinin-4-ium-5-uide
(7, PhagoGreen). Formaldehyde (30% in water, 34 μL, 341 μmol) was added
to a stirring solution of isonitrile 3 (20 mg, 57 μmol), formic acid (13
μL, 171 μmol), and diethylamine (18 μL, 171 μmol) in 600 μL of
tBuOH:CHCl3 (3:2). After 16 h the solvent was removed under pressure, and
the residue was carefully dried in vacuo. 25 mg of adduct 7 as a pure
orange solid (99% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 9.58 (s, 1H), 7.73
(d, J = 8.2 Hz, 2H), 7.24 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 2H), 5.98 (s, 2H), 3.18 (s,
2H), 2.73-2.62 (m, 4H), 2.55 (s, 6H), 1.44 (s, 6H), 1.12 (t, J = 7.1 Hz,
6H) ppm. 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.5, 155.6, 143.3, 141.5, 138.6,
131.8, 130.5, 128.9, 128.4, 125.4, 121.3, 119.7, 58.3, 48.9, 14.8, 14.7,
12.6 ppm. 19F-NMR (376 MHz, CDCl3): δ = -146.34 (q, J = 32.5 Hz) ppm. IR
(film) υmax: 3250.53, 2975.09, 2923.84, 2840.57, 1738.79, 1681.14,
1521.00, 1508.19, 1456.94, 1405.69, 1303.20, 1187.90, 1149.47, 1091.81,
1046.98, 970.11, 829.18, 765.12 cm-1. HRMS: calcd. for C25H32BF2N4O,
453.2638 (M+H+); found, 453.2635.
